main = A c a B e C D (E F d G (d e d H))
d h g f = a a f g (b a) e
c i g h f = b a
b h g f = a c g h d d e
a g h f = h b d e c c c
e f h g i = i (d a (h d d d))
------------------------------------------------------------
A c a B e C D (E F d G (d e d H))
A c a B e C D (E F d G (a a H d (b a) e))
A c a B e C D (E F d G (H b d e c c c (b a) e))


